 บ    There are three ways you can request files from Frontiers BBS:      บ
 บ                                                                        บ
 บ 1: You can type a MAGIC name from the prompt below to have that file   บ
 บ    immediately sent to you. Type MAGIC to see a list of all current    บ
 บ    MAGIC names available for download.                                 บ
 บ                                                                        บ
 บ 2: You can type FREQ to enter the User Freq prompt, where you can type บ
 บ    a list of MAGIC names or FILENAMES. All files on the list will be   บ
 บ    sent to you, provided they are currently online. You can type ? or  บ
 บ    HELP from the User Freq prompt for more information.                บ
 บ                                                                        บ
 บ 3: If you're a SysOp, you can create a ".REQ" file listing all files   บ
 บ    you're interested in. You then CRASH-Call this number and your REQ  บ
 บ    file should automatically be sent and processed the same as above.  บ
 บ                                                                        บ
 บ    You do NOT have to be a user of this bbs in order to request files  บ
 บ for downloading. They're here for the asking! So ASK! hehe             บ
